 costs about 17: 9 of lost margin plus an 8 penalty. A leftover unit mostly just costs 0.7 a day to hold, until it expires after 4 days. On top of that, actual demand averages about 1.046 × forecast and swings widely. So ordering at about the forecast (1.0) means frequent shortages, and plans that order 10–25% more come out ahead.\n\n**Likely top half:**\n- Plan 1 is the strongest: it orders every other day and has the most headroom.\n- Plan 2 is next.\n- Plan 3 and plan 7 are borderline, with plan 0 close behind them.\n- Plan 4 is weak despite its cheap ordering, because it orders right at the forecast.\n- Plan 6 is the weakest: daily ordering and no headroom."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4361, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2313, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4361}, "output_tokens": 10, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-28T22:47:32.675Z", "request_id": "req_011CgVSy6M8mc7N1FJqbFqDt"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01TXh4kNBq4rnNa1CSKDGG8B", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgVSy6cGhrAUm1oNbrg1e", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01TXh4kNBq4rnNa1CSKDGG8B", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.4, 0.8, 0.7, 0.55, 0.35, 0.3, 0.15, 0.55]}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null,